# Anonymous product/sum type CST shape. Variant names are lowercase here to
# match the tree-sitter `identifier` token (lowercase-first), mirroring the
# grammar's existing lowercase-identifier convention. Arrow returns are not in
# the minimal grammar, so the product is written as an ordinary column type.
rel resident(result: (a: int, b: text)).
rel verdict(result: (ok(value: int); err(message: text))).
rel nested(bundle: (x: int, y: (p: text, q: float))).
rel annotated(id: int, configured: configure(int, Value: 1)).
